# --------------------------------------------------- // Apps
vesktop-bin                                            # Discord client with Vencord (mod) built in — AUR, precompiled
spotify-launcher                                       # lightweight Spotify installer/launcher — same package elifouts/Dotfiles uses
proton-mail-bin                                        # Proton Mail desktop client — unofficial AUR build, precompiled (Proton doesn't publish an Arch package)
hyprmod                                                # GTK4/libadwaita live settings GUI for Hyprland — AUR, community-maintained and still in active development; writes its own hypr/hyprland-gui.conf, doesn't touch hyprland.conf
